<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
	Rift invasions (L2Rust, D-64): the zones a rift may open in. Settings: config/L2R.ini, section [RiftInvasion].

	<zone>       name: shown in the announcements; minLevel/maxLevel: the level range of the rift monsters
	             (wave 1 has minLevel, the last wave maxLevel, the boss maxLevel; plus RiftMobLevelOffset);
	             bossId: the rift boss; bossHpMultiplier: factor on its max HP (default 1).
	<spawn>      a point the rift may open at (one is picked at random). The monsters stand around it,
	             at the height of the ground (geodata) when it is loaded.
	<wave>       count: monsters of the wave (more with RiftScaleWithPlayers); each one is one of the <mob> ids.
	             Wave 1 is the first <wave>. A rift with more waves (RiftWaveCount) than the zone repeats the last.

	The monsters are the invaders of the Dimensional Rift (type RiftInvader, not spawned anywhere else),
	the boss is Anakazel, the boss of the rift rooms.
-->
